OL,3,GNEWSASpecial constable clocked at
OL,4,A106mph, panel hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA special constable who drove at speeds
OL,7,Fof up to 106mph while on duty - but not
OL,8,Ffor an emergency - has been found
OL,9,Fguilty of gross misconduct.
OL,11,FFormer volunteer officer, FSC Adam
OL,12,FJeskins, resigned from Northamptonshire
OL,13,FPolice in August, ahead of a misconduct
OL,14,Fhearing in October.
OL,16,FJeskins did not attend the hearing but
OL,17,Fgave evidence to the panel that he was
OL,18,Ftravelling at speed for policing
OL,19,Fpurposes but could not recall the
OL,20,Fdetails, due to the passage of time.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
