OL,3,GNEWSASpecial constable clocked at
OL,4,A106mph, panel hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said Jeskins, a member of the
OL,7,Froad safety team who had completed more
OL,8,Fthan 10 years of service, would have
OL,9,Fbeen sacked if he had not left the
OL,10,Fforce.
